WEBVTT

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:16.040
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:21.020
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:26.250
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.860
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.760
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:40.900
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:48.980
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.980 --> 00:01:00.290
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:09.130
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:13.770
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:17.870
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:29.270
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:47.120
- That's Joseph's...
- Joseph?

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:53.070
He's a Blassreiter known as Blue.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:55.040
These Virgin Mary carvings...

00:01:55.040 --> 00:02:00.110
Father Muller, the man who raised
Joseph at a church, used to make them.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:06.150
Joseph learned how to do it too by watching him.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:10.990
Joseph told you that much?

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:16.660
It was Joseph who infected me.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.030
You're?

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:22.800
If Joseph trusted you, then so can I.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.900
You know Joseph?

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.780
This latest incident with
Joseph has caused Zwolf

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:32.970
to begin worrying about the
very existence of Blassreiters.

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:39.420
The idea of someone with that
much power leaving their control

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:41.360
and making enemies out of everything...

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:45.730
So that's why development of the
anti-nanomachines has been unfrozen?

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:47.390
Sasha...

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:51.700
People are very foolish,

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:56.540
so they think "killers" are more
suited for this world than "killees."

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.200
But...

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:04.010
...the "killers" don't realize what they are

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:07.620
until they've killed everything.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:11.820
Mei-Fong. Who do you
think these "killers" might be?

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:16.890
I don't know. Maybe Zwolf-like cells like us.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:20.590
Or perhaps Blassreiter seeds
that have been planted in the earth.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.070
I'm counting on you.

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:27.690
Understood, Boss.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:34.440
Hermann. I'm coming with you.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:39.970
Those words alone are more
than enough for me, Amanda.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.360
An ambush, huh?

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.090
I guess Wolf is at XATHQ after all!

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:55.360
Wolf! I'm going to personally take you to hell!

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:08.910
Amanda! I won't let you
follow in Lene's footsteps!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.810
I will protect you...

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.180
...even if it costs me my life!

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:39.170
It was terrifying...

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:42.700
I had no idea what was happening to me.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:46.010
It was absolute terror...

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.370
Snow!

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.700
Snow!

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:34.260
You've done nothing wrong.
You've done nothing wrong at all.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.900
Live.

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:46.500
Live, Snow...

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:58.280
We traveled together.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:06.590
But, when I woke up one morning...

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:22.470
"Take care of yourself?"

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.980
I didn't understand why
he suddenly left me behind.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:30.890
But now I do.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:35.290
He didn't want me to get
caught up in the fighting.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.280
You're looking for Joseph, aren't you?

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:44.600
He's at the air base west of here. But...

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.790
Enhancement unit?

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.540
Yes.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.640
Joseph is completely out of control.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:56.780
He doesn't even recognize his sister Sasha.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:07:00.450
Thanks, Amanda.

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:06.950
Hermann was chasing Wolf
toward the town of Bifrost.

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:09.790
There's a XAT base in Bifrost...

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.730
That must be where he's...

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.720
Be careful, Snow...

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.110
You...

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:36.920
You bring misfortune to everything you touch!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.890
You're a devil!

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:49.890
Joseph is being driven by fear and anger...

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.110
Regain control of yourself, Joseph.

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.450
Geez...

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:19.520
This is a perfect spot to
end this once and for all.

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:07.680
Trying to go off without me again?!

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.340
Amanda!

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:15.250
As if I'd lose a fight
like this! I'm protecting you!

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:29.330
Are you okay, Hermann?!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.170
I could've handled it by my...

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.830
Hermann!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.470
Impressive.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.110
Wolf!

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:44.250
That's exactly why you
both work directly under me.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.370
Stop, Amanda!

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:49.380
Lowly human!

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:56.550
You're gravely mistaken if you
think things are how they were before!

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:00.390
Amusing!

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:03.090
Joseph Jobson!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:04.640
Joseph...

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.230
Joseph...

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:40.210
Go back to the real Joseph...

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:59.200
You've done nothing wrong...

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:14.820
You've done nothing wrong at all...

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:23.760
So... it's okay to be alive...

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:30.940
Joseph... It's okay to live...

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:40.980
Joseph. No matter how cruel the
world may be, there's a reason to live.

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.640
I'm sure of it.

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:59.460
Snow...

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:06.600
I finally found you again...

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:17.510
Wolf!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.590
I'm sorry...

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:42.970
Snow. Isn't this painful for you to handle?

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:52.890
Even if this world isn't
the world I had hoped for...

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:58.490
Even if this isn't how I had hoped to be...

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:03.930
I still want to fight to the
very end in whatever way I can...

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:18.770
Not once have I ever
regretted meeting you, Joseph...

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:42.660
It's wise not to underestimate humans!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.640
Humans, huh...

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:50.110
Amanda!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:57.180
Have you ever counted how many
squad members died horrible deaths

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.810
just to save you?!

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:04.020
Yes. I have.

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.150
Many times!

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.070
Wolf.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:17.170
Have you ever thought about
how the squad members you tricked

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:19.300
felt as they died?

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:24.080
Al, Brad, Lene...

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:32.450
All the members of XAT tried to
remain XAT members to the very end!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:34.960
Even after they realized they'd been infected,

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:39.460
they knew their duty was to
protect people from Amalgams!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:44.830
Those feelings of theirs live on inside me!

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.800
Wolf! This is payback for my comrades!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:50.700
Go to hell...!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.810
Amanda!

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:55.800
Hermann!

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:04.390
Still the same great shot as ever!

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:06.050
Boss...

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:10.120
Amanda! Hang in there, Amanda!

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:14.220
Damn!

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.510
Where the hell is it coming from?!

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:32.880
Hermann!

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:35.950
Looks like this is the end!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:41.490
Come out, Amanda. Let me give you some blood.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:48.160
Become a sublime being like us
and join us as we create a new era!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.600
Run, Amanda!

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:52.900
Do you really think I can say,
"They're all yours!" and go?!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:56.060
I can handle... this...

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:58.600
Hermann!

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:05.280
Amanda. We won't harm Hermann if you join us.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:09.010
Damn you, Wolf!

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:16.980
I'm dead either way...

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:24.900
I'll take care of Wolf!

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:28.200
Stay behind me at least this one last time!

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:29.400
Amanda!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.270
Stop, Amanda!

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.970
Die with me!

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:40.340
"Bond"

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:51.120
What am I?!

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:58.750
Back then, I!

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:07.510
Amanda!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.980
Go! Forget about us!

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.590
Wolf!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:24.990
Wolf! Not even death...

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:27.830
...can make up for what you've done!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:43.340
Amanda... Hermann...

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:55.550
None of you...

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:02.120
...make any sense to me...

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:13.670
Operation complete, Brad...

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:19.280
Hermann!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.680
- Was it Al?
- Yes.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:35.030
This is the sky I saw from the
tops of the trees when I was a kid...

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:45.940
Geez. Coming back to life sure is creepy.

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:55.440
Was that?!

00:20:57.680 --> 00:20:59.350
Yes.

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:05.160
So he ended things himself...

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:10.000
Albin Lutz...

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:27.180
There's never been a
sniper more accurate than you...

00:21:54.270 --> 00:22:05.390
I dreamed of that day we chased shooting stars

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:15.800
What we had kept safe disappeared like sand

00:22:15.800 --> 00:22:19.870
Just another illusion

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:28.970
Asleep, inside memories

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:32.510
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.510 --> 00:22:41.050
Holding countless wishes with both hands

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:43.620
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:51.570
Quietly by your side, as you sleep

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:57.200
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.200 --> 00:23:03.180
Holding countless wishes

00:23:03.180 --> 00:23:08.940
Yes, right beside you

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:16.720
Behold, a pale horse.

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:22.530
And his name that sat on him was
Death. And Hell followed with him.

00:23:22.530 --> 00:23:26.870
Episode 20: "Legion from the Netherworld."

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:31.460
The great day of His wrath is
come, and who shall be able to stand?
